type: software
title: "sparky-ca: install the CA certificates PJeOffice needs"
abstract: "A graphical tool that downloads and installs the CA certificates required by PJeOffice, the Brazilian electronic judicial system (ICP-Brasil). A fork of Paweł Pijanowski's SparkyLinux tool, sparky-ca."
